Package: xxc-aptd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, apt-utils, dpkg (>= 1.22), gnupg, ca-certificates, adduser, systemd | systemd-standalone-sysusers
Description: signed Debian APT repository daemon and local administration
 XXC-APTD stages binary Debian packages, builds signed atomic archive
 generations, serves an accessible package browser and provides a local
 management socket plus authenticated HTTP administration with roles,
 staging review and background jobs. TLS is handled by an upstream proxy.
